        "content": "<p><img alt=\"screenshot.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1119x336\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/14278/Tiki-S3gerLa084h5b4sQL8M/screenshot.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/14278/Tiki-S3gerLa084h5b4sQL8M/screenshot.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\nIs there a difference between putting a proof method in <code>MA_{n+1}</code> as opposed to <code>MA_n</code>?</p>",
